(property "ReqNotes" "Precision 10nF option: C0G/NP0, so capacitance is stable over voltage, temperature (+/-30ppm/C) and age, with low dielectric absorption. Prefer this over OW-CAP-10N-0603-X7R-50V for filter corners, integrators, sample-and-hold and timing networks. C0G at 10nF forces the larger 0805 body; use the 0603 X7R part where board area matters more than accuracy."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name yes)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
