	(text "Analog output 0-1.650 V | DAC80501 on I2C, 987 Hz Sallen-Key, OPA197 x1.32, /2 divider" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1b12e7a-102d-5ce4-a8b1-2296addb6a08"))
	(text "Single-channel buffered 0-1.650 V precision analog voltage output, safe on a Neuropixels OneBox ADC channel or an unprotected 3.3 V MCU pin: a DAC80501ZDGSR at 3.3 V on I2C at address 0x48 on its internal 2.5 V reference, a 2-pole 987 Hz Sallen-Key reconstruction filter, an OPA197 on a ferrite-filtered 5 V rail at a non-inverting DC gain of 1.32 that is also the filter's active element, a /2 output divider, a 249 ohm series output resistor, an ESD clamp and a separately isolated monitor tap." (at 15.24 21.082 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d22ba93-d490-5748-bda7-48b35f4f8b0c"))
	(text "Matching net labels are connected. Group order explains function; PCB placement priorities are stated below." (at 15.24 26.322 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8df65ffb-6cd5-5b17-8b4e-c695407e8d73"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 15.24 36.482) (xy 226.126667 36.482)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "e36295da-5a36-54b9-b650-0093eb8f645a"))
	(text "1. DAC and address straps" (at 15.24 39.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7be086eb-813b-5934-96f1-68c9c21243a2"))
	(text "${24d00200-3e57-477a-88e4-3a12e5d04184:REFERENCE} generates 0-2.5 V on its internal reference; ${f8688b17-aef3-4d25-a6f7-ffc6ba63afa5:REFERENCE} selects I2C, ${8bcec26c-47a1-4f63-b2ea-af49d8755659:REFERENCE} sets the address 0x48, ${02721415-8ba6-44c2-bb42-79442b7769a4:REFERENCE} bypasses VREFIO. ${63077e7f-8ada-416b-8c34-2a43286e78d9:REFERENCE} filters +5V to +5V_FILT for ${4431d64b-6575-4991-8a5f-ed6cdd1169e7:REFERENCE} (${5a700702-33b8-45f5-8ad8-058bac6a43c5:REFERENCE}, ${ce655a76-34af-4ba4-a7b2-d464d3cd53af:REFERENCE}," (at 15.24 43.172 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d054eff6-2a02-52f9-89fa-0d2757dd6807"))
	(text "${d8e98eee-0cc8-4470-8c9f-b100ffae449c:REFERENCE}, ${cf0d0d63-30b7-401b-8aef-cdadd8bdf773:REFERENCE}); ${ab409005-71d3-438b-8449-fd1b17ee5db9:REFERENCE} filters +3.3V to +3.3V_FILT for ${24d00200-3e57-477a-88e4-3a12e5d04184:REFERENCE} (${1cccca69-c1c4-40d8-9493-be92cd66249f:REFERENCE}, ${b5882037-0345-48f5-984d-77f45c279577:REFERENCE}, ${0e1e1678-4d78-4374-b4f2-2dc92787a59e:REFERENCE})." (at 15.24 45.712 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e333105c-8a46-59d3-8dcf-ba5714ebab20"))
	(text "16-bit I2C DAC, internal 2.5 V reference" (at 20.32 167.528721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "817700e9-79df-5136-ab9f-05b2875024e2"))
	(text "${1cccca69-c1c4-40d8-9493-be92cd66249f:REFERENCE}: 3.3 V rail bulk bypass; ${b5882037-0345-48f5-984d-77f45c279577:REFERENCE}: Rail bypass; ${0e1e1678-4d78-4374-b4f2-2dc92787a59e:REFERENCE}: ${24d00200-3e57-477a-88e4-3a12e5d04184:REFERENCE} VDD pin 1 bypass; ${ab409005-71d3-438b-8449-fd1b17ee5db9:REFERENCE}: Rail ferrites" (at 20.32 170.068721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "47d45b43-909a-551e-834c-79a6194ce168"))
	(text "${8bcec26c-47a1-4f63-b2ea-af49d8755659:REFERENCE}: A0 strap to GND, address 0x48" (at 20.32 172.608721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "471e141e-0125-5628-ae78-b4779f8128b0"))
	(text "${f8688b17-aef3-4d25-a6f7-ffc6ba63afa5:REFERENCE}: SPI2C strap to VDD, I2C mode" (at 20.32 175.148721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c44ebd77-a7d3-59ba-a27c-e7e4b807b4a0"))
	(text "${02721415-8ba6-44c2-bb42-79442b7769a4:REFERENCE}: VREFIO reference bypass" (at 20.32 177.688721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "97d9a9c7-d0b1-58f3-9619-046a1e9066a1"))
	(text "PLACE: ${02721415-8ba6-44c2-bb42-79442b7769a4:REFERENCE} (0.47 uF; 150 nF or more is required) hard against pin 10 with the shortest return to pin 4 (AGND)." (at 15.24 182.768721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fd081761-6cf7-51f3-a3ee-7376bd47b49e"))
	(text "PLACE: Silkscreen the address next to ${8bcec26c-47a1-4f63-b2ea-af49d8755659:REFERENCE}." (at 15.24 186.578721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0ac1f06d-928a-5152-9a71-12c348908b87"))
	(text "PLACE: ${ce655a76-34af-4ba4-a7b2-d464d3cd53af:REFERENCE} and ${cf0d0d63-30b7-401b-8aef-cdadd8bdf773:REFERENCE} (100 nF) at ${4431d64b-6575-4991-8a5f-ed6cdd1169e7:REFERENCE} pin 5 with the return at pin 2; ${0e1e1678-4d78-4374-b4f2-2dc92787a59e:REFERENCE} (100 nF) at ${24d00200-3e57-477a-88e4-3a12e5d04184:REFERENCE} pin 1 with the return at pin 4; the 1 uF and 10 uF parts beside their ferrites." (at 15.24 190.388721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "13b42a8e-73c8-57a4-9a68-66c79d426275"))
	(text "ROUTE: SCL and SDA run straight from the ports to pins 6 and 8; no termination or tap inside the block (conventions 10 and 14: the shared I2C pulls are the board's)." (at 15.24 194.198721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c8fff12-5189-5541-81f8-71ccf46d27a6"))
	(text "ROUTE: +5V and +3.3V arrive at ${63077e7f-8ada-416b-8c34-2a43286e78d9:REFERENCE} and ${ab409005-71d3-438b-8449-fd1b17ee5db9:REFERENCE} pad 1 (PWR_5V_LOCAL and PWR_3V3_LOCAL vias, convention 1); the filtered rails stay inside the block." (at 15.24 198.008721 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "09072b27-b9e8-51f0-b295-cf472caaad1e"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 233.746667 36.482) (xy 444.633333 36.482)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "fb75486b-c207-5593-96e0-c5b7e25d0bea"))
	(text "2. Reconstruction filter and gain amplifier" (at 233.746667 39.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02d77abf-c564-5ec8-abc4-f7fe68ccea7e"))
	(text "${12c2acd0-8430-4790-ac32-4be182d997cc:REFERENCE}, ${3c358923-568c-48e4-809b-1376db674363:REFERENCE}, ${b5c142ab-08ce-4cdc-89a2-66ccda3ccf86:REFERENCE} and ${9f051feb-a78d-4a6e-95cb-c8f96096b79c:REFERENCE} around ${4431d64b-6575-4991-8a5f-ed6cdd1169e7:REFERENCE} form the 987 Hz Sallen-Key filter; ${2a0b7571-9426-44a3-ac48-cb2dd542e144:REFERENCE} and ${c039fa40-db02-46e8-85fc-2fd38ad08cfb:REFERENCE} set the gain 1.32 and ${d76599b4-736e-4e7e-be47-1a194b515e41:REFERENCE} compensates the gain network. ${63077e7f-8ada-416b-8c34-2a43286e78d9:REFERENCE} filters +5V" (at 233.746667 43.172 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "007dd886-9fd6-529a-83a1-d20279fbd9c9"))
	(text "to +5V_FILT for ${4431d64b-6575-4991-8a5f-ed6cdd1169e7:REFERENCE} (${5a700702-33b8-45f5-8ad8-058bac6a43c5:REFERENCE}, ${ce655a76-34af-4ba4-a7b2-d464d3cd53af:REFERENCE}, ${d8e98eee-0cc8-4470-8c9f-b100ffae449c:REFERENCE}, ${cf0d0d63-30b7-401b-8aef-cdadd8bdf773:REFERENCE}); ${ab409005-71d3-438b-8449-fd1b17ee5db9:REFERENCE} filters +3.3V to +3.3V_FILT for ${24d00200-3e57-477a-88e4-3a12e5d04184:REFERENCE} (${1cccca69-c1c4-40d8-9493-be92cd66249f:REFERENCE}, ${b5882037-0345-48f5-984d-77f45c279577:REFERENCE}, ${0e1e1678-4d78-4374-b4f2-2dc92787a59e:REFERENCE})." (at 233.746667 45.712 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "67bef406-f553-5151-a92a-9fcc080b091c"))
