	(text "PLACE: Keep DAC_VOUT_FILT_MID and DAC_VOUT_FILT short and guarded by analog ground; ${2a0b7571-9426-44a3-ac48-cb2dd542e144:REFERENCE}, ${c039fa40-db02-46e8-85fc-2fd38ad08cfb:REFERENCE} and ${d76599b4-736e-4e7e-be47-1a194b515e41:REFERENCE} tight to ${4431d64b-6575-4991-8a5f-ed6cdd1169e7:REFERENCE} pins 1 and 4." (at 233.746667 358.572592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "639316b1-c2e8-5c93-8e38-1efca19eb51a"))
	(text "PLACE: Pull the ground pour back from under AMP_FB: ${d76599b4-736e-4e7e-be47-1a194b515e41:REFERENCE} compensates about 8 pF of input capacitance and plane capacitance there changes it." (at 233.746667 362.382592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "15dd0633-7527-52a5-8040-f7f2afc63ab7"))
	(text "PLACE: ${ce655a76-34af-4ba4-a7b2-d464d3cd53af:REFERENCE} and ${cf0d0d63-30b7-401b-8aef-cdadd8bdf773:REFERENCE} (100 nF) at ${4431d64b-6575-4991-8a5f-ed6cdd1169e7:REFERENCE} pin 5 with the return at pin 2; ${0e1e1678-4d78-4374-b4f2-2dc92787a59e:REFERENCE} (100 nF) at ${24d00200-3e57-477a-88e4-3a12e5d04184:REFERENCE} pin 1 with the return at pin 4; the 1 uF and 10 uF parts beside their ferrites." (at 233.746667 366.192592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "00095b34-14dd-52a6-9bd4-4e3b1839776c"))
	(text "ROUTE: DAC_VOUT, AMP_VOUT and VREFIO deserve their own netclass rather than Default." (at 233.746667 370.002592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4fca44e5-15f0-54b6-805e-5e226b4f3d3d"))
	(text "ROUTE: +5V and +3.3V arrive at ${63077e7f-8ada-416b-8c34-2a43286e78d9:REFERENCE} and ${ab409005-71d3-438b-8449-fd1b17ee5db9:REFERENCE} pad 1 (PWR_5V_LOCAL and PWR_3V3_LOCAL vias, convention 1); the filtered rails stay inside the block." (at 233.746667 373.812592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4e1dbe98-f766-511f-aa9b-1d0330366108"))
